  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e01-scene-20",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "我想了个后备方案  (I Thought Up a Backup Plan)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Out in the corridor, Bu Xiaogu pitches a smart backup plan to Chun Yuqiao: if sought-after idol Yin Zhengyu falls through, invite his beloved younger brother Yin Jiaxi instead. Listen first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我有点担心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "担心什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "尹正宇现在太热门，工作邀约特别多。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "所以我想了个后备方案，不知道可不可行。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "继续。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "尹正宇的亲弟弟尹家希，他哥哥特别疼他。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "尹家希出道两年了，现在特别火。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我知道了，不错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大认可了，我立马就去执行！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我有点担心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am a little worried.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "担心什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Worried about what?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "尹正宇现在太热门，工作邀约特别多。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yin Zhengyu is too sought-after right now, and he has tons of work offers.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "所以我想了个后备方案，不知道可不可行。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So I thought up a backup plan; I do not know whether it is workable.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "继续。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Go on.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "尹正宇的亲弟弟尹家希，他哥哥特别疼他。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yin Zhengyu's own younger brother Yin Jiaxi — his older brother dotes on him.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "尹家希出道两年了，现在特别火。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yin Jiaxi debuted two years ago, and right now he is really popular.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我知道了，不错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Got it — not bad.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大认可了，我立马就去执行！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The boss approved it — I will go carry it out right away!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我有点担心。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "担心什么？",
      "gap": 0.5
