    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "继续。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "尹正宇的亲弟弟尹家希，他哥哥特别疼他。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "尹家希出道两年了，现在特别火。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我知道了，不错。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大认可了，我立马就去执行！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "For the first time, Chun Yuqiao gives Xiaogu's idea a nod of approval. Next, Wang Er hands her the contacts to execute it herself. You heard \"danxin\", \"jixu\", and high praise \"bucuo\".",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
